      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """This hub holds a working session opened under [steering-group pressure to decide the shape now](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1), resolving into a cutover doctrine: [a sequential one-site-at-a-time commitment, no parallel cutovers even for the small sites](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), defended as [contained pain with a named owner versus unbounded concurrent risk](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13), and [summed as one at a time, with a soak](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_16).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """Two isolation rules qualify the sequencing: [reporting reads barred from the live system during cutover windows](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_26), ratified as [a runbook rule rather than negotiable guidance](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31), and [vendor-held reference data persisting until the final site goes green](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_36).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The session closes with [a read-back of the full position for the steering group](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42).""" ]
