      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """Newer attachments extend the span well beyond the session: [retention mandates and extraction scoping sequenced ahead of vendor decommissioning agreements](narr:Position_DecommissioningRetentionSequencing), [preservation of closed legacy records in self-describing open archives](narr:Position_LegacyRecordArchivalStrategy), [an unvoiced question about cross-site operational learning and skill compounding](narr:Position_CrossSiteOperationalLearning), [separation of cutover gate-approval rights from schedule incentives](narr:Position_CutoverGatekeeperRoleSeparation), [definition and testing of pre-cutover source data quality thresholds](narr:Position_PreCutoverDataQualityGateEnforcement), and [how unresolved programme vulnerabilities are presented to oversight bodies](narr:Position_ProactiveGovernanceRiskDisclosure) — the last three carrying no voiced claim yet, standing as open frames alongside the settled doctrine.""" ]
    ) ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
}